OL,3,GNEWSADog groomers lodge pet daycare
OL,4,Acentre plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog grooming business is seeking
OL,7,Fplanning permission to expand to offer
OL,8,Fdaycare services.
OL,10,FThe proposals for the site on Heworth
OL,11,FRoad in Concord, Washington, include
OL,12,Fmoving the existing dog grooming
OL,13,Ffacilities into a smaller room and
OL,14,Fusing the main floorspace to
OL,15,Faccommodate the proposed dog daycare.
OL,17,FA planning statement submitted to
OL,18,FSunderland City Council said the
OL,19,Ffacility would improve local access to
OL,20,Fthe service and reduce the need for
OL,21,Fresidents to travel further afield.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
